      "owner": "unoplatform",
      "issue": null,
      "reason": "The skia-canvas page is compile-gated to Skia desktop and Skia WebAssembly and reports completed RenderOverride calls without claiming pixel verification; cross-target fixture comparison cannot reference a renderer-only slug."
    },
