      "owner": "unoplatform",
      "issue": null,
      "reason": "Uno source marks its samples manual and hardware-acceleration-dependent; Gallery does not currently resolve Uno.WinUI.Graphics3DGL, so adding the feature would be a speculative package and bundle increase."
    },
